description: Keep the KindSem preview fast — curl first, never next dev
alwaysApply: true
---

# Preview (fast path)

- URL: `http://127.0.0.1:43127/`
- Cursor Preview/Start runs `npm start`, which must serve `out/` (`scripts/preview.sh serve`). Never `next start` (static export has no server) and never `next dev` (iframe blocks its JS).
- Before any restart or rebuild, run: `npm run preview:check`. If it is 200, **stop**.
- Rebuild only after source/UI changes: `npm run build`, then `npm run preview:restart`.
